Package: lg-webos-cosmic
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libsecret-tools
Description: COSMIC panel applet for controlling LG webOS TVs
 A COSMIC panel applet for discovering LG webOS televisions on the local
 network, pairing securely, and controlling apps, inputs, and picture settings.
 A compatible COSMIC desktop session is required to use the applet.
